ind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.4: voice control understands you even better","summary":"We keep going! I went through every voice phrase that failed and every report from this week, and 1.0.4 is the result. Voice control Understands many more real phrases: \"maintain present altitude\", \"continue approach\", \"proceed to\", spelled-out fixes, and the callsign said at the end of the instruction. Callsigns with the digits in the wrong order, or registrations with an extra letter, now work when only one aircraft matches. A frequency with one wrong digit now contacts the right unit. Tower a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:55:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041872","verified_at":"2026-10-25T15:45:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1847286114028345","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.3: pick your microphone, and voice control understands you better","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing the demo during Next Fest! I've read every survey, bug report and voice phrase you sent, and 1.0.3 comes straight from them. Microphone setting New in Settings > Audio: choose which microphone voice control uses. TEST MICROPHONE button: it listens for 5 seconds, shows the live level and the phrase it understood, so you know the game hears you before your shift starts. Voice control Voice messages now show in your language (they used to be in Spanish even when playing i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028345","verified_at":"2026-10-21T13:48:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1846651706690939","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"Palma Rush: win the full game + demo 1.0.2","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46210631/79c6f6992232e94e34b40c0e7cb4515d6e94b17f.gif Steam Next Fest is live and the free demo of ATC: Tower & Ground is in it. To celebrate, our first challenge: Palma Rush. 🏆 How it works Pick your league: a Tower or a Ground shift at Palma de Mallorca, on OPERATOR. You can enter both. Finish the shift: the end screen shows your score and a PALMA RUSH verification code. Press F12 to take a Steam screenshot. Post it in #palma-rush on Discord or in the Palma Rush thread on th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690939","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1846651706678365","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"Free demo on October 15 at 17:00 CEST — and our roadmap","summary":"The free demo of ATC: Tower & Ground lands on Steam on October 15 at 17:00 CEST (Spain time). Palma de Mallorca, Tower and Ground, real procedures and voice control. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46210631/b5a75eb3bc67ff030896c379d798d6f19c434aa1.png What comes next Demo fixes driven by your feedback Voice control fine-tuning Pilot voices per airline: 30+ voices with different accents Finishing the new airports Full game in November: the exact date depends on your feedback and the fixes Coming soon: online ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:08:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1846018067925135","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"We're going to Steam Next Fest! The free demo lands next week","summary":"ATC: Tower & Ground is going to Steam Next Fest! ✈️ From October 19 to 26 we'll be part of Steam Next Fest, and the free demo lands next week. Everything you sent me is in there Every bug you reported during the playtest has been fixed in the demo. Your ideas and suggestions are coming to the demo or to the full game. I've read every single one. What you'll find Real Spanish airports, built from public aeronautical data. Tower and Ground control: vectors, ILS approaches, taxiing, takeoffs. AI pi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:27:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925135","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1844751498235211","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo coming soon, playtest this week, and a look at what's next","summary":"The demo is almost here. ATC: Tower & Ground is getting ready for its demo launch, and before that, a group of selected players will get Playtest access this week. If you requested access, keep an eye on your Steam library and notifications. Stay tuned, because something big is coming. 👀 New airports in development: Ibiza and Menorca Palma de Mallorca is no longer alone. We're building Ibiza (LEIB) and Menorca (LEMH) with the same attention to detail: real runways, taxiways and stands, Tower and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T18:56:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1842212951297941","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"🛫 Tower to all pilots: Ground footage is on the frequency","summary":"The tower has something to share.New Ground gameplay is live and ready to watch. See aircraft guided from gate to runway and back, stands assigned, pushbacks managed, and traffic routed across the whole airport without a single conflict. Take a look and tell me what you think.📻 Meanwhile in the cabinI've moved my attention up to the Tower. Clearing departures, sequencing arrivals, keeping the skies in order under pressure, built with the same precision as Ground.🔒 Something big is inboundI can't","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T19:10:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4868560-1837955055366341","game_id":"steam-4868560","kind":"announcement","title":"Tower to all aircraft: the demo is on final approach 🛫","summary":"🛫 Tower to all aircraft: the demo is on final approachThe airspace is about to open. ATC: Tower & Ground is coming very soon in demo form, and from the control cabin we want you to be one of the first to take the controls. Coordinate departures, manage ground traffic, sequence approaches and keep order in the skies. All with the precision only a real controller understands. If aviator mode is your thing, this one's for you. ✈️ 📡 Tune in to our frequency on Discord Don't lose radio contact. Join ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T14:50:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4868560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4868560":"2026-1